      "body": "Anthropic's `/v1/messages` converter hoists any in-message `system` turn into the leading system block unless the prompt renderer says it keeps system turns where they are. For `dsv41` that question was answered by the Jinja probe, and DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash ships no `chat_template`, so the probe answers False and every multi-turn Anthropic request gets a rewritten prompt prefix — which is exactly what defeats the radix cache.\r\n\r\n`spec_supports_inline_system` already exists as the escape hatch for encoders with no Jinja source (`kimi_k3` uses it); `dsv41` belongs in the same set.\r\n\r\nThe `dsv4` family now renders through `deepseek-recipe`, which converts the message list itself, so there is nothing for the probe to read either way — the allowlist is still the right place to answer, and the comment now points at that instead of the removed `encoding_dsv41.render_message`.\r\n\r\nTests: `test/registered/unit/entrypoints/anthropic/test_serving.py` covers the allowlist answer and that `AnthropicServing` stops merging inline system turns for `dsv41`.\r\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #41648168597](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41648168597)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41648168751](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41648168751)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #41648168692](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41648168692)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Base CI only covers the core cases, and its workload may not exercise your change. Use `/rerun-test` to run the tests your change touches, or copy this prompt for an agent:\n>\n> ```text\n> Find the registered tests this PR affects and run them with /rerun-test, following https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.agents/skills/rerun-test/SKILL.md\n> ```\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
      "changedFiles": 2,
